<title>UK: Citibank warrants on Generale des Eaux.</title>
<headline>Citibank warrants on Generale des Eaux.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued six million call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Generale des Eaux, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE  ISS PRICE  PREMIUM    GEARING    MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    750.0   10.60 FRF  11.17 PCT  7.3 TIMES  25.FEB.98</p>
<p> CALL B    825.0   11.33 FRF  21.86 PCT  6.8 TIMES  25.FEB.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE  24.FEB.97     LISTING  PARIS     MIN EXER LOT  1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  770.00</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
